 "floor_rule": "1) floor_day > CT_date(quote_at+5m) or > CT_date(now) -> reject floor_day_invalid (FIRST). 2) agent only: |now-quote_at| > 5 min -> refuse quote_at_skew (poller bounds quote_at via N3 instead). 3) history unreadable or no row for floor_day -> agent refuse / poller defer floor_history_unavailable. 4) effective(t) = latest floor_day whose earliest first_seen_at <= t; floor_day must be in {effective(quote_at-30m), effective(quote_at+5m)} else reject floor_day_not_in_effect. 5) F_signed >= min(recorded values for floor_day) else reject floor_below_history. 6) amount_sat >= min_sat(F_signed) else payment_below_floor. ntfy floor_mismatch whenever F_signed is not one of the recorded values for floor_day (independent of the result). History is evaluated as visible at 'now' (rows with first_seen_at <= now). Window is -30/+5 (\u00a718.1); F1-F15 results are unchanged under -30/+5.",
